  "description": "Your E-Trail Machine for Going Big\n\nCrafted for big missions and aggressive riders, the 2026 Collosus TE8 electric MTB is Polygon's new e-trail machine. It's built with a full carbon frame, and both the front and rear triangles are designed to be agile, responsive, and ready for anything.The Collosus TE8 electric MTB features the proven compact model of the IFS (Independent Floating Suspension) system, used on the Collosus N and DH series. This system delivers exceptional small-bump sensitivity and strong mid-stroke support, pairing perfectly with air shocks for a confident and balanced ride.The 29er-wheel setup provides a playful yet planted feel. The quiet and natural-feeling BOSCH Performance Line CX motor, with 100 Nm of torque and an 800 Wh battery, brings effortless power to every climb and sprint.An extended chainstay enhances rear-wheel traction, and the UDH-compatible hanger supports modern drivetrains. The low standover height keeps your center of gravity low and lets you charge harder and ride sharper, no matter what the trail throws your way.",
